  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs TestFramework.Core 0.7.0 and TestFramework.Config 0.4.0 (EF Core 10 on net10.0); in-process Function App execution moved to the new TestFramework.Azure.Functions package, and services.LoadAzureConfigs() is services.AddAzure(). BREAKING - one name per resource: Cosmos is CosmosDb (CosmosDbConfig, CosmosDbIdentifier, CosmosDbRef), SQL is SqlDatabase (SqlDatabaseRowArtifact*, SqlDatabaseRowArtifactQueryFinder), tables are StorageAccountTableEntityArtifact*, with the namespaces DB.CosmosDb and DB.SqlDatabase, AzureResourceKinds, AzureConfigExtension and the trigger factories IsLiveTriggers, LogicAppTriggers, FunctionAppTriggers and ServiceBusTriggers. BREAKING - the config keys QueueContainerName, TableContainerName and RequiredSession are QueueName, TableName and RequiresSession, and an entry using an old key is refused. Catch FrameworkConfigurationException where you caught ConfigurationValidationException.",
